%% Figure: State lifecycle of an emergency report.
%% Render to: Images/Chapter 3/emergency-lifecycle.png
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open: Emergency submitted
    Open --> InProgress: Authority starts work
    InProgress --> Resolved: Authority completes work
    Open --> Resolved: Authority resolves directly
    Open --> Reclassified: Authority marks as false emergency
    InProgress --> Reclassified: Authority marks as false emergency
    Resolved --> [*]
    Reclassified --> [*]
